Z||000000||firstfiero||06-03-2001||10:47 AM||||      Well I guess the title says it all. Here in little york we have the biggest hot rod show on the east coast and the 2nd biggest in the country! Last night down town they had cops standing at every corner...If you screached your tires they would call up to a cop further ahead. $300 fine for a tire screach...THATS CRAZY! Anyone else been hit for this...Is this the typical fine or did they pump it up since the rods were in town? Their were kids drunk as hell but all the cops were worried about was the kids screaching tires!!<P>------------------<BR>Hey Mr. Ricer come over here and tell me how your stickers make you faster.....<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/headshot.gif">         <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif"> ||||reg||13
Z||000001||fyerstarter||06-03-2001||11:32 PM||||My friend got a ticket for screeching tires. I think it was "exhibition of speed" they got him for. The fine was like $70 <P>It seems like law enforcement is becoming more of a fund raising activity. Especially when it comes to harrassing automotive enthusiasts. Here in California whenever there is a big race at Pomona, especially Imports, the cops are out in full force pulling anyone over with a non stock carf and giving out tickets for window tint, loud stereos, too low, modified exhaust. Same thing with the street races. I've seen tickets given out for low windshield wiper fluid, low tire pressure... you name it.<p>[This message has been edited by fyerstarter (edited 06-03-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||loafer87gt||06-04-2001||12:16 AM||||I have got a ticket for squeeling tickets in, believe it or not, my 81 Tercel. I had 155/75 13 tires on that thing, and when you dumped the clutch you could roast the tires through the entire first gear, and let a hearty chirp into second. I got a stunting ticket for $65. The $300 fine seems pretty crazy to me, around here the cops are pretty lenient when the car shows are on. On the main drag when the cars are parading around, you can even do a brake torque and the POPO won't bust you. ||||reg||1
Z||000003||firstfiero||06-04-2001||06:23 AM||||    Their usually pretty easy here also. I mean the rods bring something like 27 million bucks into this town so they usually let everyone have a good time. They should do what ocean city does...designate a block area each nite to the street rods and let them screech tires to their blue in the face... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Hey Mr. Ricer come over here and tell me how your stickers make you faster.....<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/headshot.gif">         <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif"> ||||reg||1
