Z||000005||Shaft||06-05-2001||08:00 PM||||Yup! The same stuff goes on here when the Good Guys nationals is in Columbus. There were probably 300 people lining the street while street rods drove up and down. And there were a bunch of cops out. They were ticketing people for revvin their engines at a traffic light. The thing is, all the cops were on the streets that all the people were at...that meant there were NO cops anywhere else. ||||reg||13
